<title>USA: IES Utilities Iowa nuke resumes full power.</title>
<headline>IES Utilities Iowa nuke resumes full power.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>IES Utilities Inc's 538 megawatt (MW) Duane Arnold nuclear unit has returned to full power, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission (NRC) said Monday in its plant status report.</p>
<p>The unit, in Palo, Iowa, was taken off line March 14 to repair a well water leak in the containment cooling system.</p>
<p>IES Utilities is a subsidiary of IES Industries Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Power Desk +212-859-1628))</p>
